{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "510a5652ca06719f11776cfa08cfbf97d97febfb8900a0a40eccbd650c536acd", "ja": "（ドラマ『階のスターエレメンツ』の制作は順調に\n進んでいる。今日は、3人のライブシーン撮影だ）", "zh": "（电视剧《阶梯上的Star Elements》进展相当顺利。\n今天要拍她们三人在演唱会上的场景。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "117b5b0eebfb9059924d8ccd0d9684cc376c1c56b6027b8de0ec6851577832ef", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様でーす♪\n私たちのライブ、もうすぐ始まりますよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了～♪\n我们的演唱会，马上就要开始啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c9c8649a220016ea5c3f9e7d80c8d09b289338d975a57172e4034430724d2fb5", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来。\n今日はライブじゃなくて、ドラマの撮影だけどな！", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n今天哪是演唱会，是拍电视剧才对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "21e0d3b99c1c134811da3567c7f1dc8bbd027ec124214ba4c583aeef379e54e7", "ja": "あっ！　そうでした……\nつい、本物のライブみたいに思っちゃって。でへへ♪", "zh": "啊！对耶……\n一不小心就以为是真正的演唱会了，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1004_p", "source_sha256": "38fef3ef00591ed7a2b7d13b09b64fbf33150f5608dab91618a65b5f9062d0aa", "ja": "撮影って事さえ忘れなければ、本物のライブと\n同じだよ。エキストラで、お客さんも入ってるし……。", "zh": "只要你没忘记是在拍戏就好，其他都跟真正的\n演唱会没两样哦，到时也会找临演来担任观众……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1005_p", "source_sha256": "326f1b00fd4d7d36c3f1232a80cc8959cc52ce85278048f4330f6044de23952f", "ja": "せっかくだ、思いっきり楽しんでもらわないとな！", "zh": "难得有这个机会，你就尽情去享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "90cd25601695e8745f138806baa420163ba83b283b61698c99df3537d58430b6", "ja": "ですよね！\nライブをやるなら、楽しくないと♪", "zh": "说得也是！\n既然要办演唱会，那就要开开心心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "c6718310b81c4405b14e522ad4b86ea9185d8ada19eb012b8695684e698f3185", "ja": "私も、琴葉ちゃんと可奈と3人のユニットでライブ、\nすっごく楽しみだな～って♪", "zh": "能跟琴叶、可奈组成三人团体办演唱会，\n我自己也非常期待呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "a444e6ffcf9c2b822bf69bab310af1b9ab26ed2333e009b36b67fe3455c8d53e", "ja": "あっ、えっと、役での話ですよ！\nドラマの撮影なのは、忘れてないです！", "zh": "啊，我是在说我们饰演的角色喔！\n我可没忘记今天是来拍戏的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1009_p", "source_sha256": "711cb76616de03fc5890a622e78c1bbd8a081008c0b60d8dbd26ebe3e1745773", "ja": "そうだな。でも未来は、本当に\n楽しみだったんじゃないのか？　3人でのライブ。", "zh": "那就好，不过未来，你心里其实\n很期待你们三人的演唱会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "2daaa2911694a24dfcebdeae28cacba9e84034ad15171cf4937367050ad9521e", "ja": "えへへ……バレちゃいましたか？", "zh": "嘿嘿……被你看出来了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "f48e574131693278b06af4f501a8aeacfdb2724fa4ad5fdbb9d329829017a0a7", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんとも、可奈とも。\nライバル役で、すっごく大変でしたけど……。", "zh": "虽然琴叶和可奈演的都是\n我的竞争对手，真的让我非常难受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "c239ee18ebc08e6ba8c2fcdca7fe0ffacb94678c061e1cf8db33982fe022972e", "ja": "いーっぱい話し合って、役の上でケンカもして。\nみんなで、セッサタクマしたじゃないですか！", "zh": "但我们聊了好～多好多，也拍摄了吵架的场景，\n一起互相切磋琢磨了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1013_p", "source_sha256": "868076619db605ee15813e80951dd6bf13ffc3fcf743ba32914bd269319ca03f", "ja": "うん、そうだったな。", "zh": "嗯，没错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "f9066d1c598eb78cb4ab3d9b87e17b0bd04889e7f1415e7023836ede88f8b9a5", "ja": "練習してるときは、なんかもうすっごく大変で、\nこんなのできないよー！って思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "在练习时，真的叫人不晓得该如何是好，\n我甚至一度觉得自己办不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "26fe79e0feb05c811c80b64962cc3e456d59096011f98ab302b2aad0cd4bb8f3", "ja": "でも今、3人でいっしょにライブができて、\nすっごく、すーっごく楽しいです！", "zh": "但拍到现在，终于可以三个人一起办演唱会，\n我真的、真～的非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "18104232c0af7f53c698ba637a961eb7acff55cf551c770b3fc05922febb427f", "ja": "お芝居でも、大好きなふたりとケンカするのは\n苦しかったけど。私、がんばってよかったです♪", "zh": "虽然演戏时得跟我最喜欢的她们俩吵架，\n让我非常难过，但我很庆幸自己熬过来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ccdb8068bce58703f11c028a1159573034f4ec83bc96d8ae2dad3fb342cb5ba9", "ja": "うん。……未来のその努力は、\nちゃんと画面の上に表れていると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯……未来的努力，\n我想大家到时都能在萤幕上有目共睹的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8955cd449b3849d426cef8b829a7f5a0685b38ef0e53ff4c63a96bfb951504d", "ja": "本当ですか！？　えへへ、やったぁ♪\nお芝居って楽しいな～。", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿，太好了♪\n演戏真是有意思～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0123_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "eee5027d909ec3b43eeb9eacab213f35ac436f9b64b10f6aefab4cb8deef810e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私、\nまたドラマに出たいです！　よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我还想多拍一些电视剧！就麻烦你替我安排了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
